title: AudioCodes: Overall Operational State
agents: snmp
catalog: agentless
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the operational state of an AudioCodes device.
 The state of the service comes from the highest alarm severity and the operational state
 that the device reports.

 The service "System events" shows the active alarms that the device reports.

discovery:
 One service is created.
